{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ViewTransitionOptions"},{"type":"text","value":" type is used to define a\n"},{"type":"link","href":"https://developer.chrome.com/docs/web-platform/view-transitions/same-document#view-transition-types","children":[{"type":"text","value":"viewTransition type"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"code","value":"interface ViewTransitionOptions {\n  types:\n    | Array<string>\n    | ((locationChangeInfo: {\n        fromLocation?: ParsedLocation\n        toLocation: ParsedLocation\n        pathChanged: boolean\n        hrefChanged: boolean\n        hashChanged: boolean\n      }) => Array<string> | false)\n}","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"viewtransitionoptions-properties","children":[{"type":"text","value":"ViewTransitionOptions properties"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ViewTransitionOptions"},{"type":"text","value":" type accepts an object with a single property:"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"types-property","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"types"},{"type":"text","value":" property"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Array<string> | ((locationChangeInfo: { fromLocation?: ParsedLocation toLocation: ParsedLocation pathChanged: boolean hrefChanged: boolean hashChanged: boolean }) => (Array<string> | false))"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Required"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Either one of:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"An array of strings that will be passed to the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"document.startViewTransition({update, types}) call"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A function that accepts "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"locationChangeInfo"},{"type":"text","value":" object and returns either:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"An array of strings that will be passed to the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"document.startViewTransition({update, types}) call"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"false"},{"type":"text","value":" to skip the view transition"}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"viewtransitionoptions-properties","text":"ViewTransitionOptions properties","level":2},{"id":"types-property","text":"types property","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe `ViewTransitionOptions` type is used to define a\n[viewTransition type](https://developer.chrome.com/docs/web-platform/view-transitions/same-document#view-transition-types).\n\n```tsx\ninterface ViewTransitionOptions {\n  types:\n    | Array<string>\n    | ((locationChangeInfo: {\n        fromLocation?: ParsedLocation\n        toLocation: ParsedLocation\n        pathChanged: boolean\n        hrefChanged: boolean\n        hashChanged: boolean\n      }) => Array<string> | false)\n}\n```\n\n## ViewTransitionOptions properties\n\nThe `ViewTransitionOptions` type accepts an object with a single property:\n\n### `types` property\n\n- Type: `Array<string> | ((locationChangeInfo: {\n  fromLocation?: ParsedLocation\n  toLocation: ParsedLocation\n  pathChanged: boolean\n  hrefChanged: boolean\n  hashChanged: boolean\n}) => (Array<string> | false))`\n- Required\n- Either one of:\n  - An array of strings that will be passed to the `document.startViewTransition({update, types}) call`\n  - A function that accepts `locationChangeInfo` object and returns either:\n    - An array of strings that will be passed to the `document.startViewTransition({update, types}) call`\n    - or `false` to skip the view transition\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: ViewTransitionOptionsType\ntitle: ViewTransitionOptions type\n---\n\nThe `ViewTransitionOptions` type is used to define a\n[viewTransition type](https://developer.chrome.com/docs/web-platform/view-transitions/same-document#view-transition-types).\n\n```tsx\ninterface ViewTransitionOptions {\n  types:\n    | Array<string>\n    | ((locationChangeInfo: {\n        fromLocation?: ParsedLocation\n        toLocation: ParsedLocation\n        pathChanged: boolean\n        hrefChanged: boolean\n        hashChanged: boolean\n      }) => Array<string> | false)\n}\n```\n\n## ViewTransitionOptions properties\n\nThe `ViewTransitionOptions` type accepts an object with a single property:\n\n### `types` property\n\n- Type: `Array<string> | ((locationChangeInfo: {\n  fromLocation?: ParsedLocation\n  toLocation: ParsedLocation\n  pathChanged: boolean\n  hrefChanged: boolean\n  hashChanged: boolean\n}) => (Array<string> | false))`\n- Required\n- Either one of:\n  - An array of strings that will be passed to the `document.startViewTransition({update, types}) call`\n  - A function that accepts `locationChangeInfo` object and returns either:\n    - An array of strings that will be passed to the `document.startViewTransition({update, types}) call`\n    - or `false` to skip the view transition\n"}
